    "description": "This dataset contains oceanographic data collected from NOAA Ship OKEANOS EXPLORER in the Gulf of Mexico from 2020-03-03 to 2020-03-08. Data acquisition from shipboard sensors includes navigational data, meteorological data (depth, relative humidity, temperature, wind, wind speed), and oceanographic data (bathythermograph, sound velocity probe, thermosalinograph, winch vehicles). Additional data include Profile Data (ASVP and XBT).",
